<h1>Privacy Policy for Kun Khmer Mobile</h1>

<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 25, 2026</p>

<p>
This Privacy Policy explains how Kun Khmer Mobile ("We", "Us", or "Our")
collects, uses, stores, and protects Your information when You use
Kun Khmer Mobile (the "Service").
</p>

<p>
By downloading, installing, or using the Service, You agree to this
Privacy Policy.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>1. Definitions</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Application</strong> means Kun Khmer Mobile.</li>
    <li><strong>Account</strong> means Your game account.</li>
    <li><strong>Company</strong> means Kun Khmer Mobile.</li>
    <li><strong>Country</strong> means Cambodia.</li>
    <li><strong>Device</strong> means any device used to access the Service.</li>
    <li><strong>Personal Data</strong> means information that identifies or can identify You.</li>
    <li><strong>Service</strong> means Kun Khmer Mobile.</li>
    <li><strong>You</strong> means the player using the Service.</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

<h3>Account Information</h3>

<p>Depending on how You sign in, We may collect:</p>

<ul>
    <li>Display Name</li>
    <li>Email Address (if provided)</li>
    <li>Player ID</li>
    <li>Avatar URL</li>
    <li>Authentication Provider ID</li>
</ul>

<h3>Facebook Login</h3>

<p>
If You choose to sign in using Facebook Login, We may receive the
following information from Facebook after You grant permission:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Facebook User ID</li>
    <li>Profile Picture (Avatar URL)</li>
    <li>Email Address (if permission is granted)</li>
</ul>

<p>
We use this information only to:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Create or link Your game account.</li>
    <li>Authenticate Your login.</li>
    <li>Display Your name inside the game.</li>
    <li>Use Your Facebook profile picture as Your in-game avatar.</li>
</ul>

<p>
We do not post anything to Your Facebook account and do not access
additional Facebook information without Your permission.
</p>

<h3>Gameplay Information</h3>

<p>We collect gameplay information such as:</p>

<ul>
    <li>Wins and Losses</li>
    <li>Rank</li>
    <li>Leaderboard Position</li>
    <li>Match Results</li>
    <li>Game Statistics</li>
    <li>Achievements</li>
    <li>Chat Messages</li>
</ul>

<h3>Usage Information</h3>

<p>We may automatically collect:</p>

<ul>
    <li>IP Address</li>
    <li>Device Type</li>
    <li>Operating System</li>
    <li>Game Version</li>
    <li>Crash Logs</li>
    <li>Diagnostic Information</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>

<p>We use Your information to:</p>

<ul>

<li>Create and manage Your account.</li>

<li>Authenticate login.</li>

<li>Save game progress.</li>

<li>Display leaderboards.</li>

<li>Show Your avatar and display name.</li>

<li>Enable multiplayer gameplay.</li>

<li>Enable in-game chat.</li>

<li>Process purchases.</li>

<li>Prevent cheating and fraud.</li>

<li>Improve gameplay and stability.</li>

<li>Provide customer support.</li>

<li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>

</ul>

<hr>

<h2>4. Leaderboards and Public Information</h2>

<p>
Some information is visible to other players, including:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Display Name</li>
<li>Avatar</li>
<li>Rank</li>
<li>Leaderboard Position</li>
<li>Match Statistics</li>
</ul>

<p>
This information is necessary for multiplayer features and leaderboards.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>5. In-Game Chat</h2>

<p>
Messages sent through the in-game chat may be stored temporarily to
deliver the service, investigate abuse, and enforce our Terms of Service.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
We use trusted third-party services to operate the game.
These may include:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Facebook Login (Meta)</li>
<li>Google Play Services</li>
<li>Apple Game Center</li>
<li>Payment providers</li>
<li>Cloud hosting providers</li>
</ul>

<p>
Each third-party service has its own privacy policy.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>7. Sharing Your Information</h2>

<p>We may share information:</p>

<ul>

<li>With authentication providers to verify Your identity.</li>

<li>With payment providers to process purchases.</li>

<li>With hosting providers that operate game servers.</li>

<li>When required by law.</li>

<li>To protect the security of the Service.</li>

</ul>

<p>
We do not sell Your Personal Data.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>8. Data Retention</h2>

<p>
We retain Your information only as long as necessary to operate the game,
comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.
</p>

<hr>

<h2>9. International Transfers</h2>

<p>
Your information may be processed on servers located outside Your country.
By using the Service, You consent to such transfers.
</p>

<hr>

